{"ticker":"LLY","updated":"2026-10-30T22:56:56Z","profile":{"longName":"Eli Lilly and Company","shortName":"Eli Lilly and Company","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - General","country":"United States","website":"https://www.lilly.com","fullTimeEmployees":50000,"marketCap":1262666776576,"trailingPE":47.584423,"forwardPE":28.719135,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":14.60372,"pegRatio":1.32,"targetMeanPrice":1377.7117,"targetHighPrice":1650.0,"targetLowPrice":930.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":29,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.386,"earningsGrowth":0.163,"grossMargins":0.83634,"operatingMargins":0.53661996,"profitMargins":0.31898,"totalRevenue":86461997056,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1449.6799,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":834.19,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.5},"summary":"Eli Lilly and Company discovers, develops, manufactures, and markets human pharmaceutical products in the United States, Europe, China, Japan, and internationally. The company offers cardiometabolic health products, including Basaglar, Humalog, Humalog Mix 75/25, Humalog U-100, Humalog U-200, Humalog Mix 50/50, insulin lispro, insulin lispro protamine, insulin lispro mix 75/25, Humulin, Humulin 70/30, Humulin N, Humulin R, Humulin U-500 for diabetes; Jardiance, Mounjaro, and Trulicity for type 2 diabetes; and Zepbound for obesity. It also provides oncology products, such as Cyramza for the second-line treatment of gastric cancer or gastro-esophageal junction adenocarcinoma; Erbitux for colorectal cancers and head and neck cancers; Inluriyo for breast cancer; Jaypirca for chronic lymphocytic leukemia or small lymphocytic lymphoma; Retevmo for the treatment of metastatic NSCLC; TYVYT for classic hodgkin's lymphoma; and Verzenio for breast cancer. In addition, the company offers immunology products, which include Ebglyss; Olumiant; Omvoh; and Taltz. Further, it provides Emgality for migraine prevention and episodic cluster headache; and Kisubla for symptomatic Alzheimer's disease. The company has collaborations with Boehringer Ingelheim Pharmaceuticals, Inc. for the Jardiance product family; and F. Hoffmann-La Roche Ltd and Genentech, Inc. for lebrikizumab, as well as license agre","summary_zh":"禮來公司在美國、歐洲、中國、日本和國際上發現、開發、製造和銷售人類藥品。該公司提供心臟代謝健康產品，包括Basaglar、Humalog、Humalog Mix 75/25、Humalog U-100、Humalog U-200、Humalog Mix 50/50、閑泌胰島素、賴脯胰島素魚精脯蛋白、賴脯胰島素混合75/25、優泌林、優林泌素、 Jardiance、Mounjaro 和 Trulicity 用於治療第 2 型糖尿病；和 Zepbound 治療肥胖。它還提供腫瘤產品，例如用於胃癌或胃食道交界腺癌二線治療的Cyramza；愛必妥（Erbitux）用於治療結直腸癌和頭頸癌； Inluriyo 治療乳腺癌； Jaypirca 用於治療慢性淋巴細胞白血病或小淋巴細胞淋巴瘤； Retevmo) 的經典轉移性非小細胞肺癌；達伯型淋巴瘤。此外，該公司還提供免疫學產品，其中包括 Ebglyss；奧盧米特；天啊！和塔爾茨。此外，它還提供 Emgality 來預防偏頭痛和陣發性叢集性頭痛； Kisubla 用於治療有症狀的阿茲海默症。該公司與 Boehringer Ingelheim Pharmaceuticals, Inc. 就 Jardiance 產品系列進行合作；以及 F. Hoffmann-La Roche Ltd 和 Genentech, Inc. 的 lebrikizumab 以及許可協議","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"藥品製造商 - 一般","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":727.99,"h":737.14,"l":723.64,"c":735.19,"v":3222500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":732.02,"h":737.83,"l":729.02,"c":737.83,"v":2222500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":736.32,"h":747.0,"l":735.33,"c":742.91,"v":2423400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":744.7,"h":744.7,"l":722.57,"c":727.21,"v":3958200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":729.71,"h":742.7,"l":719.22,"c":738.64,"v":4534600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":734.18,"h":752.84,"l":733.87,"c":750.61,"v":2986900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":748.09,"h":755.8,"l":742.49,"c":754.62,"v":2477400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":752.48,"h":761.13,"l":750.37,"c":756.28,"v":2197500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":760.17,"h":761.6,"l":748.0,"c":755.39,"v":2198300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":753.07,"h":756.34,"l":742.11,"c":748.19,"v":2790900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":745.41,"h":770.38,"l":744.54,"c":764.71,"v":3881300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":761.49,"h":776.96,"l":756.34,"c":760.13,"v":3471200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":761.38,"h":772.54,"l":759.01,"c":762.93,"v":3464000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":765.0,"h":765.0,"l":749.2,"c":751.99,"v":7349500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":748.56,"h":762.0